      <p>
        The China origin choice follows the export base — Shanghai and Ningbo-Zhoushan for East China,
        Shenzhen and Guangzhou for the Pearl River Delta. The UAE destination choice is what changes
        the DDP calculation, because Jebel Ali, Khalifa and Sharjah serve different emirates and
        different free-zone/mainland mixes.
      </p>

