    <div class="grid grid--2 mt-2">
      <Card title="Insist on these in a DDP quote">
        <ul>
          <li>Duty and VAT calculated on your actual HS codes and CIF value.</li>
          <li>Destination THC, port charges, clearance and brokerage fees.</li>
          <li>Free-zone vs mainland treatment stated for the final consignee.</li>
          <li>Delivery to a named address with access type stated.</li>
        </ul>
      </Card>
      <Card title="Watch for these exclusions">
        <ul>
          <li>Demurrage and detention after the free-time allowance.</li>
          <li>Customs inspection or re-examination charges.</li>
          <li>Remote-area or restricted-access delivery surcharges.</li>
          <li>Duty/VAT adjustments if HS classification changes during audit.</li>
        </ul>
